0 1 1.257-.649c1.51.481 2.989.606 4.604.457a1 1 0 1 1 .184 1.992c-1.846.17-3.598.03-5.396-.543a1 1 0 0 1-.649-1.257Zm-4.194-4.55 1.293-1.292a.5.5 0 0 1 .707 0l1.293 1.292a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708l-1.293 1.292a.5.5 0 0 1-.707 0l-1.293-1.292a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708Zm9.717-.537a.165.165 0 0 1 .03-.155c.707-.863 1.067-1.28.972-1.484-.095-.204-.646-.196-1.762-.21a.165.165 0 0 1-.137-.076c-.602-.946-.887-1.422-1.11-1.394-.222.027-.382.555-.734 1.617a.164.164 0 0 1-.114.107c-1.08.278-1.616.403-1.659.623-.043.221.411.54 1.309 1.208.045.033.07.087.067.143-.066 1.117-.113 1.67.084 1.779.196.108.635-.222 1.543-.87a.164.164 0 0 1 .156-.02c1.04.414 1.547.63 1.71.478.165-.153-.017-.677-.355-1.746Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">YES!! GTA Cheat Central is LIVE!</span> 🎉🎮</p></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">That means people can now visit your website by typing:</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-inline=""><span class="Trigger-C5mz9C" data-d-component="popover-trigger" data-d-inline="" data-d-inline-text="" role="presentation" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><a class="" href="https://gtacheatcentral.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted">GTACheatCentral.com</span><span class="ms-1"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-KLrnew" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.243 6.757a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7.072a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4.657L8.464 16.95a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l6.778-6.779H9.172a1 1 0 0 1 0-2h7.07Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a></span></span></span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">You successfully connected Porkbun to GitHub Pages!</p><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">What's next?</h3><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">There are three things I'd recommend:</p><ol class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Finish HTTPS security</span> — Once GitHub makes the option available, enable <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-font-style="italic" data-d-inline="">Enforce HTTPS</span>.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Get on Google</span> — Set up Google Search Console so Google can discover your website when people search for GTA cheats.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Finish Google AdSense</span> — Your website has advertising placeholders, but actual ads require approval and setup.</p></div></div></li></ol><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">I recommend getting your website on Google next.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">One important difference: Your website opening when someone types its address doesn't automatically mean it appears in Google search results.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Want me to walk you through getting <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">GTA Cheat Central on Google</span>, one step at a time?</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><span data-state="closed" class="contents">