="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Suggesting GitHub Connector for Upload Automation</span></p></div></span></span></div></div></div></div><div hidden=""><div><div class="flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col gap-2 self-start"><span class="flex max-w-[min(100%,var(--resource-card-max-width,100%))] flex-col overflow-hidden font-sans text-default [--resource-card-row-padding-x:0.75rem] electron:elevation-stroke extension:border extension:border-default extension:bg-background-primary-soft/50 extension:shadow-sm bg-surface-elevated-secondary/50 rounded-2xl mt-3 select-none"><span class="group/resource-card relative" data-automation-card="true"><button aria-label="Daily GTA Gaming Blog" aria-describedby="_r_2eg_" type="button" class="peer/resource-card cursor-interaction rounded-[inherit] bg-transparent group-hover/resource-card:bg-background-primary-ghost-hover/30 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-inset relative w-full"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center text-start gap-2.5 px-[var(--resource-card-row-padding-x)] py-3 pointer-events-none relative z-10"><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-surface-secondary/92 text-secondary"><svg aria-hidden="true" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-9df9ab66b410511a.svg#clock-light-24" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col"><span class="truncate text-default text-size-chat font-medium"><span id="_r_2eh_">Daily GTA Gaming Blog</span></span><span class="truncate text-secondary text-size-chat-sm"><span id="_r_2eg_">Daily at 7:20 PM</span></span></span><span class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="flex h-token-button-composer shrink-0 items-center gap-1 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-default bg-transparent px-2 py-0 text-base leading-[18px] whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover">Open</span></span></span></button></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block-BQZwFn"><div data-content-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-17:2:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-17:2:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-message-ids="4b34976b-9db0-4e1e-b7b1-b66db6802ef3 4b34976b-9db0-4e1e-b7b1-b66db6802ef3"><h4 class="sr-only m-0 select-none print:not-sr-only print:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1">ChatGPT said:</h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="6ad8073e-071c-83e8-9d18-4f624f89d202" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="4b34976b-9db0-4e1e-b7b1-b66db6802ef3"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_2ek_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="4b34976b-9db0-4e1e-b7b1-b66db6802ef3" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="1" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="dark" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-d-inline-reveal="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="4b34976b-9db0-4e1e-b7b1-b66db6802ef3"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="center" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" data-d-component="icon" style="color: var(--color-text-success); font-size: 18px;"><path d="M12 4C7.58172 4 4 7.58172 4 12C4 16.4183 7.58172 20 12 20C16.4183 20 20 16.4183 20 12C20 7.58172 16.4183 4 12 4ZM2 12C2 6.47715 6.47715 2 12 2C17.5228 2 22 6.47715 22 12C22 17.5228 17.5228 22 12 22C6.47715 22 2 17.5228 2 12ZM16.0755 7.93219C16.5272 8.25003 16.6356 8.87383 16.3178 9.32549L11.5678 16.0755C11.3931 16.3237 11.1152 16.4792 10.8123 16.4981C10.5093 16.517 10.2142 16.3973 10.0101 16.1727L7.51006 13.4227C7.13855 13.014 7.16867 12.3816 7.57733 12.0101C7.98598 11.6386 8.61843 11.6687 8.98994 12.0773L10.6504 13.9039L14.6822 8.17451C15 7.72284 15.6238 7.61436 16.0755 7.93219Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Your daily gaming blog schedule is set up!</span> 🎮</p></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">I'll prepare <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">one original gaming blog every day</span> for <span class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-inline=""><span class="Trigger-C5mz9C" data-d-component="popover-trigger" data-d-inline="" data-d-inline-text="" role="presentation" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><a class="" href="https://gtacheatcentral.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted">GTA Cheat Central</span><span class="ms-1"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-KLrnew" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.243 6.757a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7.072a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4.657L8.464 16.95a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l6.778-6.779H9.172a1 1 0 0 1 0-2h7.07Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a></span></span>.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">The blogs will focus on GTA V cheat codes, hidden secrets, story missions, tips and tricks, and other gaming topics.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Each blog will include an SEO-friendly title, a description for Google, organized sections, and a suggested page URL.</p><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">One more step for automatic uploading</h3><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Your website is hosted on GitHub, so I need a GitHub connection to publish directly to your repository:</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">theporkypro3233-ui/gtacheatcentral</code></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">I've made the GitHub connection option available. <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Connect GitHub and authorize access to your website repository.</span> Until that's connected, the daily blogs can be written, but they won't automatically appear on your website.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">I also recommend adding a <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Gaming Blog</span> section to your homepage so visitors can find all your articles without affecting the existing cheat codes.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Would you like the blogs to focus mostly on GTA, or cover all video games?</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 electron:[&amp;&gt;svg]:icon-sm flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Copy"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.468 10.4107 13.468 9.91717 13.4367 9.53369C13.4137 9.25191 13.3758 9.0622 13.3244 8.91846L13.2687 8.78858C13.1148 8.48652 12.8803 8.23344 12.593 8.05713L12.466 7.98584C12.308 7.90546 12.0963 7.84854 11.7209 7.81787C11.3374 7.78656 10.8439 7.78662 10.133 7.78662H7.29999C6.58895 7.78662 6.09562 7.78654 5.7121 7.81787C5.43015 7.84091 5.24064 7.87872 5.09686 7.93018L4.96698 7.98584C4.66487 8.13977 4.41184 8.37419 4.23554 8.66162L4.16522 8.78858C4.08477 8.94657 4.02794 9.15811 3.99725 9.53369C3.96594 9.91718 3.96