49956 15.6538 8.63652 15.5602L8.78399 15.4498C8.93677 15.3239 9.12233 15.1398 9.47149 14.7907L14.4588 9.80238L11.2332 6.57679L6.2459 11.5651ZM15.7635 5.27308C14.9282 4.43776 13.6058 4.38573 12.7098 5.11683L12.5369 5.27308L12.1736 5.63636L15.4002 8.86195L15.7635 8.49964L15.9197 8.32581C16.6016 7.48961 16.6016 6.28311 15.9197 5.44691L15.7635 5.27308Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block-BQZwFn"><span hidden="" data-chatgpt-agent-turn-start=""></span><div data-content-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-18:1:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-18:1:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-message-ids="4c91f162-494c-4a8c-90e1-a4cafc4b6514 4c91f162-494c-4a8c-90e1-a4cafc4b6514"><h4 class="sr-only m-0 select-none print:not-sr-only print:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1">ChatGPT said:</h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="6ad8073e-071c-83e8-9d18-4f624f89d202" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="4c91f162-494c-4a8c-90e1-a4cafc4b6514"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_2fe_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="4c91f162-494c-4a8c-90e1-a4cafc4b6514" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="2" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="dark" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-d-inline-reveal="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="4c91f162-494c-4a8c-90e1-a4cafc4b6514"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">That's called a <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">favicon</span>! It's the little icon that appears in your browser tab next to your website name.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">For <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">GTACheatCentral.com</span>, you can replace that globe with your own GTA Cheat Central logo.</p><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">Step 1: Get your logo ready</h3><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">I recommend a square image, <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">512 × 512 pixels</span>, saved as <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">favicon.png</code>. Your existing green-and-black GC logo would be a good choice.</p><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">Step 2: Upload it to GitHub</h3><ol class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Open your <span class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-inline=""><span class="Trigger-C5mz9C" data-d-component="popover-trigger" data-d-inline="" data-d-inline-text="" role="presentation" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><a class="" href="https://github.com/theporkypro3233-ui/gtacheatcentral?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted">GTA Cheat Central GitHub repository</span><span class="ms-1"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-KLrnew" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.243 6.757a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7.072a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4.657L8.464 16.95a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l6.778-6.779H9.172a1 1 0 0 1 0-2h7.07Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a></span></span>.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Click <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Add file → Upload files</span>.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Upload <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">favicon.png</code>.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Click <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Commit changes</span>.</p></div></div></li></ol><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">Step 3: Add it to your website code</h3><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Open <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">index.html</code> in GitHub, click the pencil icon to edit it, and add this line directly below <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">&lt;head&gt;</code>:</p><div><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-code-block="true" data-markdown-copy="code-block" data-theme="dark" class="relative Root-iW7ipz w-full min-w-0 contain-inline-size overflow-clip rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle text-default CodeSurface-UAMd1A Surface-BCuIs1 dark @container" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" contenteditable="false" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none ActionBar-KWWAct min-h-12 gap-2 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-RZfVQh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-9df9ab66b410511a.svg#code-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate">HTML</div><div class="ms-auto flex items-center min-w-0 max-w-full"><div data-code-block-controls="true" role="presentation" class="flex items-center gap-px print:hidden flex-wrap justify-end"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex borde