</span></code></pre></div></div></div><button class="group/scroll-to-bottom cursor-interaction absolute z-30 flex h-8 w-8 translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-default bg-surface bg-clip-padding text-secondary transition-opacity duration-basic ease-in-out end-1/2 print:hidden pointer-events-none opacity-0 bottom-4" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Scroll to bottom" tabindex="-1" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC text-default" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-9df9ab66b410511a.svg#arrow-down-lg-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Then click <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Commit changes</span>.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">After GitHub republishes the website, refresh <span class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-inline=""><span class="Trigger-C5mz9C" data-d-component="popover-trigger" data-d-inline="" data-d-inline-text="" role="presentation" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><a class="" href="https://gtacheatcentral.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted">GTACheatCentral.com</span><span class="ms-1"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-KLrnew" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.243 6.757a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7.072a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4.657L8.464 16.95a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l6.778-6.779H9.172a1 1 0 0 1 0-2h7.07Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a></span></span>. If the old globe remains, try a hard refresh using <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Command + Shift + R</span>.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">One question:</span> Do you want to use the <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">GC logo already on your website</span>, or would you like me to create a new gaming-style favicon for GTA Cheat Central?</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 electron:[&amp;&gt;svg]:icon-sm flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Copy"><svg width="21" height=